sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Instruct CSMS to retrieve a FullInventory report
    CSMS->>CS: GetBaseReportRequest (requestId, reportBase = FullInventory)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestId has integer value >= 0<br>reportBase = FullInventory
    CS-->>CSMS: GetBaseReportResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: CSMS receives all NotifyReportRequest messages<br>for this requestId and is able to show the result of full inventory to an operator
